<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-13T16:11:18.790Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:11:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;PKK militants have withdrawn from four camps in northern Iraq as part of a peace process with Turkey, while Iranian drones have struck Kurdish opposition groups in Iraq. Two suicide deaths were reported in Baghdad and Mosul, and a fraud network targeting pensioners was broken up. Iraq’s deputy industry minister was arrested on bribery allegations, and the supreme court ruled the Kurdistan state security law unconstitutional. Prime Minister Barzani met U.S. Consul General Wendy Green in Erbil and called for coordinated security between the Peshmerga and Iraqi army, and a railway yard between Baiji and Baghdad was cleared. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxObkVlOE1sdWNnV1ZnUmRnbnNKcC04X3p3U3k1amttRHJ3WnpZalFqSV9IYlhaTS1mZkE2NGtzY1VKRWhqVkJvcEt1bFFxWUJ2bjVMMlVmVzZVMkJUVEVhZDFsNUhCdDNNZW41VzVsbEZkSkpOdkUzcE1KVDItMjdhUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPMDJNcTBjVEs2dnk4Zl9JQ1VhY1diTTBOcm5OdGV6NEE1R3dVMDVFNG1RODhpVmJKcUE5ek5hWDVfc2s5cGZ0S2Z6TUUxRExFVGpqbTdLOWxaZlY4UXNkcE05bkVVX0I4OVpNVFp0eDBUMlNDQVFYRGp2cHVpQVVmOThJaXk1cnhhRUtrMzBEZkZ4RHJOWlFDeFlzOExOS0VldGZ4MlB1amtpb1ZnLUF1YVRjaTdydEk4WFhsdmE2NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNdUFIbGtYbDlmSzdQZVI4elhrZFBBNXJUSS1Sd1A0RHFhd0EzcWc1VnNyU1N4X2g1YnZ3ajFLNTJkY0QybmdQRm9ZMGVyQ0pjUVZEMUx1NkR6ektnTmFveU1CSVQ5eEpId2VnN2ctdlZYS1g2eGZVQy1la3MwTjJ1elJWM3ZjR28?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/art